  m_text: "My dearest boy,\n\nThe doctor says more of me will soon slip away. Before
    it does, I need to leave you this.\nIn the attic is a box tied with an old ribbon.
    I always said it was \u201Cjust papers,\u201D but they are not only mine. They
    belonged to someone you\u2019ve asked me about before. Perhaps you guessed, from
    the way I sometimes fell silent at a song, or looked at the door as if expecting
    someone to walk through.\nWhen you are ready, open it. Inside is not every answer,
    but enough to explain why I have loved you twice over \u2014 once as your mother, "
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a4a59b93957e3e7439b920fc11cc2b1e, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -8127164950067652670, guid: a4a59b93957e3e7439b920fc11cc2b1e, type: 2}
